{"facts":[{"id":"fact_1","kind":"want","text":"Find the dwarves' hoard marked on the party's map, which Grimny's ghost identified as Bral's treasure map.","state":"open","change":"updated","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior","beat_74","beat_75"]},{"id":"fact_new_1","kind":"could_use","text":"Grimny's ghost says Bral probably hid the hoard in the Dragon's Lair marked on the map; the dwarves had scouted it as a very small cave, one big room, empty and unvisited.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_77","beat_20"]},{"id":"fact_new_2","kind":"blocked_by","text":"The dragon is believed to occupy the Dragon's Lair where the hoard is probably hidden, standing between the party and the treasure.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":"thread_2","also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_20","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_3","kind":"could_use","text":"Dr. Uriah's Read Languages spell lets him read the writing under one location on the treasure map per day.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_19"]},{"id":"fact_new_4","kind":"unknown","text":"What is the one remaining unidentified location on the treasure map? Sir Phidipal